# `$` labels a pipeline stage's value in a macro's text (S14): one
# token touching the name or tuple it gives, drawn as a small triangle.
== SOURCE
it $h $(q, k)
== TOKENS
0..2 Var(it)
3..4 Label
4..5 Var(h)
6..7 Label
7..8 LParen
8..9 Var(q)
9..10 Comma
11..12 Var(k)
12..13 RParen
== RENDER
it ▹h ▹(q, k)
